## STEP 4 — DESIGN SYSTEM (`app/globals.css` — FULL REPLACEMENT)

**Design principles in priority order:**
1. Clarity > decoration
2. Hierarchy > density
3. Restraint > trend
4. Evidence > assertion
5. Motion supports understanding — never competes with it

